┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                    ENTROPY AGENT                        │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│                                                         │
│  1. DISCOVER PODS                                       │
│     └── Watch K8s API for pods with                     │
│         label: sentinel.io/monitored=true               │
│                                                         │
│  2. CAPTURE BASELINE (on pod start)                     │
│     ├── Filesystem: hash executables in /bin, /usr/bin  │
│     ├── Processes: list running processes               │
│     ├── Network: list listening ports                   │
│     ├── Packages: list installed packages               │
│     └── Users: list users/groups                        │
│                                                         │
│  3. MONITOR (every N seconds)                           │
│     └── Compare current state vs baseline               │
│     └── Detect drift (new files, processes, ports...)   │
│                                                         │
│  4. REPORT                                              │
│     └── Send drift events to API server                 │
│                                                         │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
